  "prefLabel": "He-P 4020.11 Occupational Dose Limits for Minors",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4020.11 Occupational Dose Limits for Minors. The annual occupational dose limits for minors shall be 10 percent of the annual occupational dose limits specified for adult workers in He-P 4020.05.\n\nSource. #5903, eff 2-1-95; ss by #6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #8481, eff 11-5-05; ss by #10604, eff 5-23-14; ss by #14028, eff 7-23-24",
